The '''Raven's Peak starfighter depot''' was an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] facility on the [[planet]] [[Eriadu]]. It was located on the foot of a [[mountain]] housing [[Raven's Peak]], [[Governor]] [[Wilhuff Tarkin]]'s compound, and stored a number of [[Alpha-3 Nimbus-class V-wing starfighter|Alpha-3 ''Nimbus''-class V-wing starfighters]] that acted as an air wing for the fortress. It also acted as a base station for the [[Raven's Peak Sky Rail]] system, housing the lower end of the cables that allowed the rail cars to move to and from the remote tower.<ref name="Plan 99" />

